Collection: Pricing

---
Name: HistoricalPrices

Request:
POST {{host}}/post

Query:
type: historical
startDate: {{quoteStartDate}}
endDate: 2026-06-24

Headers:
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant: {{tenantId}}

Body:
{
  "discriminators": [
    {
      "points": [
        {
          "data": "2026-01-01",
          "value": 73.2
        },
        {
          "data": "2026-01-02",
          "value": 41.6
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
Tests:
- status is 200
- header content-type contains json